      "value": "We had searchable YouTube when we launched on Steam in Feb of 2016. It was fun and worked pretty well. It sadly had to go for a long drawn out reason with tech that wasn't connected to us. It also needed better and safer search. I personally really liked that feature. It allowed me to hang out and share videos with my friends including my own. Like to see it come back but probably not the near future. We've got too much other stuff in the works.",
